## Summary
The Russian Ministry of Emergency Situations has issued a weather warning for Kalmykia, forecasting heavy rain, hail, and winds up to 22 m/s. Residents are advised to wear reflective clothing when outdoors, and drivers are urged to observe speed limits and maintain safe following distances.

## Key Points
- Severe weather warning issued for Kalmykia including heavy rain, hail, and wind speeds up to 22 m/s
- Residents advised to wear clothing with reflective elements while walking outdoors
- Drivers cautioned to follow speed limits and maintain safe distances during adverse weather


